  "hallmark": "the reflexed violet border round each wing case, and the long runner's legs",
  "reference": {
    "title": "Käferbuch. Naturgeschichte der Käfer Europas, table 3 figure 9",
    "artist": "Emil Hochdanz",
    "year": 1876,
